[Unit]
Description=Hourly CVE check of the images in the repos
Documentation=file:///home/pi/Projects/Server/4-Security-Monitoring/README.md

[Timer]
# Hourly at :17. Most runs only re-match cached SBOMs (~30 s, no registry); a few SBOMs per hour are rebuilt so Docker Hub's rate limit is never touched. The Trivy DB itself is republished about daily, so a new CVE shows within an hour of that, not at the next 04:10.
OnCalendar=*-*-* *:17:00
Persistent=false

[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target
